<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Strong<br/></td>\n<td>1d6x10 minutes<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td>Overwhelming<br/></td>\n<td>1d6 days<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>Each round, you can turn to detect undead in a new area. The spell can penetrate barriers, but 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt blocks it.</p><p><i>Arcane Material Component:</i> A bit of earth from a grave.</p><p/>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 SpellsD-E');
